Package: wpprobe
Version: 0.12.11
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Alienkrishn [Anon4You]
Depends: curl, golang
Section: web
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/Chocapikk/wpprobe
Description: Fast tool to fingerprint and enumerate WordPress plugins and themes
 wpprobe downloads a WordPress page and fingerprints installed plugins
 and themes, then brute-forces them against the official WordPress
 plugin and theme repositories to detect active components.
